{
  "id": "DEU.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Ng'Atutik 6",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kagiilet agobo kasetab it.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ng’atutiet anyun, ak konetisiosiek, ak kiruogutik, che king’at Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’ kinetak, si kobiit oyai eng’ emet ne olandoi oname kobunjok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si kobiit igonyit Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’, ak irib konetisiosiekyik tugul ak ng’atutikyik, che ang’atin, inye, ak wering’ung’, ak mochogoreng’ung’, betusieguk tugul kote isobe; si kochang’ait betusieguk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogaso, ee Israel, ak orib oyai; si komieit eng’ inye, ak ochang’aitu mising’, eng’ emet ne nyiitat chego ak kumik, ko u ye kiiarorun Jehovah, Kamuktaindetab kwanisieguk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogaso, ee Israel; agenge Jehovah Kamuktaindennyo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kanyol icham Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’ eng’ muguleldang’ung’ tugul, ak eng’ sobondang’ung’ tugul, ak eng’ kimnateng’ung’ tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ingotebe muguleldang’ung’ ng’alechu kang’atin raini: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak inet lagoguk eng’ kagiiletab ge, ak ing’alale ye itebye eng’ gong’ung’, ak ye iwendoti eng’ oret, ak ye irue, ak ye ing’eete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iratyi eung’ung’ si koek kaborunet, ak koek ratutik che kirate anok eng’ turietab togeng’ung’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak isirji tugatugikab gong’ung’, ak ormarichoguk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kagomutin Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’ iwe emet ne kiiyosiechi kwanisieguk, Abraham, Isak, ak Jakobo, kole konin; nganasok che eechen ak ko miachen che kima iteeche, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gorik che nyiitotin tuguk tugul che miachen, che kima inyiiti, ak keringonik che bo beek che kima ibale, mbarenikab sabibuk ak emitik, che kima imine, ak iam ak ibiye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ripge anyun si meutie Jehovah, ne kiimutun imong’une emetab Misri, eng’ gotab otwoknatet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iywei Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’; ak iot, ak iyosie eng’ kainennyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amosub kanamonik, agot che bo bororiosiek che negitenok; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amu tinyei ng’etkong’ Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’ ne mi kwenung’ung’; si malalyo neregekab Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’ eng’ inye, ak kowong’un eng’ ng’ony.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amotiem Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’, ko u ye kiotiem eng’ Masa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orib ng’atutikab Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’ eng’ kagiiletab ge, ak baornatosiekyik, ak konetisiosiekyik, che king’atin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iyai ne bo iman ak ne mie eng’ taitab Jehovah: si komieit eng’ inye, si iwe inam kobunjin emet ne mie ne kiiyosiechi Jehovah kwanisieguk, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kole onei buniguk tugul eng’ taing’ung’, ko u ye kigomwa Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye tun teebenen wering’ung’ kole, Bo nee baornatosiechu, ak konetisiosiek, ak kiruogutik, che king’atak Jehovah Kamuktaindennyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilenji anyun wering’ung’, Kigi otwogikab Parao eng’ Misri; ak kiimoong’wech Jehovah eng’ Misri eng’ eut ne kim: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kiibarta Jehovah kaborunoik ak kwong’utik, che eechen, che bichien, che kibire Misri, ak Parao, koboto bikyik tugul, kegeerei: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kiimutwech eng’ oloto kebwa olito, kogonech emet ne kiiyosiechi kwanisiekyok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak king’atech Jehovah keyai konetisiosiechu tugul, kiywei Jehovah Kamuktaindennyo, si ketepte mieindo kotugul, si koribech kesopche ko u ra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egu anyun imanda eng’ achek, ngigiilge keyai ng’atutioni tugul eng’ taitab Jehovah Kamuktaindennyo, ko u ye king’atech.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
